OL,3,GNEWSA'Unauthorised' caravan dwellers
OL,4,Atold to leave site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in their caravans at a
OL,7,Fresidential park without having
OL,8,Fplanning permission to do so have been
OL,9,Ftold to leave.
OL,11,FTwo enforcement notices relating to
OL,12,F"unauthorised development" in parts of
OL,13,FBraydon Residential Park near Royal
OL,14,FWootton Bassett have been issued by
OL,15,FWiltshire Council.
OL,17,FThe council said in both cases
OL,18,F"hardstanding, fencing and sewerage
OL,19,Fsystems have also been installed" which
OL,20,Fdo not comply with planning policies.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
