OL,3,GNEWSA'Unauthorised' caravan dwellers
OL,4,Atold to leave site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority also said people meeting
OL,7,Fthe "planning definition of gypsies and
OL,8,Ftravellers" must stop living on the
OL,9,Fland within 18 months of the notices
OL,10,Ftaking effect while everyone else has
OL,11,Fnine months.
